  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Mental health and psychosocial support activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the work of the NLRC Mental Health and Psychosocial Support (MHPSS) Advisor, including staff time, travel and activity-related costs. Through technical guidance, coordination and capacity strengthening, it helps National Society partners integrate MHPSS across their programmes and operations. As a cross-cutting theme of the NLRC&#x2013;Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs Partnership, MHPSS contributes to more holistic and people-centred humanitarian action.</narrative>
  </description>
